 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.7472527472527473, "y1": 0.10256410256410256}, {"text": "\u201cThe power of imagination is infinite, allowing the reader to transcend their world, regardless", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.12198912198912198, "x1": 0.8747252747252747, "y1": 0.1351981351981352}, {"text": "of how mundane or exciting it may be. Imagination may lead to new lands of emotion,", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.1383061383061383, "x1": 0.8186813186813187, "y1": 0.15151515151515152}, {"text": "thought and spirituality as the writer enters new realms of the insight into self, others and the", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.14685314685314685, "x1": 0.8703296703296703, "y1": 0.17327117327117328}, {"text": "world.\u201d", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.1717171717171717, "x1": 0.17912087912087912, "y1": 0.18181818181818182}, {"text": "Evaluate this statement in light of your study of Armstrong\u2019s Unfolding Florence.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.20435120435120435, "x1": 0.7813186813186813, "y1": 0.21756021756021757}, {"text": "Question 8 \u2014 Shakespearean Drama ~ William Shakespeare, King Henry IV, Part 1", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.2867132867132867, "x1": 0.8373626373626374, "y1": 0.29914529914529914}, {"text": "(20 marks)", "x0": 0.24395604395604395, "y0": 0.30225330225330227, "x1": 0.33076923076923076, "y1": 0.3146853146853147}, {"text": "\u201cThe power of imagination is infinite, allowing the reader to transcend their world, regardless", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.3348873348873349, "x1": 0.8747252747252747, "y1": 0.3480963480963481}, {"text": "of how mundane or exciting it may be. Imagination may lead to new lands of emotion,", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.351981351981352, "x1": 0.8186813186813187, "y1": 0.3651903651903652}, {"text": "thought and spirituality as the writer enters new realms of the insight into self, others and the", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.35975135975135974, "x1": 0.8703296703296703, "y1": 0.3861693861693862}, {"text": "world.\u201d", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.38461538461538464, "x1": 0.17912087912087912, "y1": 0.3947163947163947}, {"text": "Evaluate this statement in light of your study of Shakespeare\u2019s King Henry IV, Part 1.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.4172494172494173, "x1": 0.8142857142857143, "y1": 0.43045843045843046}, {"text": "End of Section II", "x0": 0.42967032967032964, "y0": 0.4988344988344988, "x1": 0.5736263736263736, "y1": 0.508935508935509}], [{"text": "Section III \u2014 Module C: The Craft of Wri", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.09090909090909091, "x1": 0.5428571428571428, "y1": 0.10178710178710179}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.12665112665112666, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.13597513597513597}, {"text": "Attempt Question 9", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.14374514374514374, "x1": 0.29120879120879123, "y1": 0.1561771561771562}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.16161616161616163, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.17094017094017094}, {"text": "Answer the question ina SEPARATE writing booklet. Extra writing booklets are available.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.19425019425019424, "x1": 0.8593406593406593, "y1": 0.20745920745920746}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.22921522921522922, "x1": 0.5340659340659341, "y1": 0.24242424242424243}, {"text": "\u00a9 Craft language to address the demands of the question", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.2400932400932401, "x1": 0.6186813186813187, "y1": 0.2665112665112665}, {"text": "\u00a9 Use language appropriate to audience, purpose and context to deliberately shape", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.8296703296703297, "y1": 0.2789432789432789}, {"text": "meaning", "x0": 0.1835164835164835, "y0": 0.28205128205128205, "x1": 0.25164835164835164, "y1": 0.29526029526029524}, {"text": "Question 9 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.32400932400932403, "x1": 0.321978021978022, "y1": 0.337995337995338}, {"text": "I was at a perilous age when I committed my crime. Although in my thirties, I", "x0": 0.2164835164835165, "y0": 0.35742035742035744, "x1": 0.8494505494505494, "y1": 0.3706293706293706}, {"text": "still clung to a teenager\u2019s physical pursuits and mental habits. It was 2005, but", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.3745143745143745, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.3877233877233877}, {"text": "1999 was how I partied. For many reasons, I didn\u2019t know who I was yet. Now", "x0": 0.2175824175824176, "y0": 0.39083139083139085, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.40404040404040403}, {"text": "that I have a better idea, I will tell you this: I am an ugly woman. Not the kind", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.39937839937839936, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.4234654234654235}, {"text": "of ugly that guys write or make movies about, where suddenly I have a blast of", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.4234654234654235, "x1": 0.8527472527472527, "y1": 0.4366744366744367}, {"text": "blinding instructional beauty. I am not about teachable moments. Nor am I", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.4397824397824398, "x1": 0.8494505494505494, "y1": 0.452991452991453}, {"text": "beautiful on the inside. I enjoy lying, for instance, and am good at selling people", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.4560994560994561, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.4693084693084693}, {"text": "useless things for prices they can\u2019t afford. Of course, now that I am", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.47241647241647244, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.48562548562548563}, {"text": "rehabilitated, I only sell words. Collections of words between cardboard covers.", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.4887334887334887, "x1": 0.8494505494505494, "y1": 0.5019425019425019}, {"text": "Books contain everything worth knowing except what ultimately matters.", "x0": 0.2164835164835165, "y0": 0.5058275058275058, "x1": 0.8054945054945055, "y1": 0.519036519036519}, {"text": "LOUISE ERDRICH, The Sentence", "x0": 0.6, "y0": 0.5384615384615384, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.5508935508935509}, {"text": "(a) Continue this extract as a piece of imaginative, discursive or persuasive writing that 12", "x0": 0.13516483516483516, "y0": 0.5788655788655789, "x1": 0.910989010989011, "y1": 0.6052836052836053}, {"text": "shapes a particular perspective.", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6045066045066045, "x1": 0.4318681318681319, "y1": 0.6177156177156177}, {"text": "Note: You are NOT required to write out the extract as part of your response.", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6371406371406372, "x1": 0.8032967032967033, "y1": 0.6503496503496503}, {"text": "(b) Compare how you have used language in part (a) to shape a perspective with the way 8", "x0": 0.13516483516483516, "y0": 0.6860916860916861, "x1": 0.9175824175824175, "y1": 0.6993006993006993}, {"text": "writing has been crafted in at least ONE prescribed text from Module C.", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.7031857031857032, "x1": 0.7626373626373626, "y1": 0.7163947163947164}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are listed on page 11.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.752913752913753, "x1": 0.46153846153846156, "y1": 0.7661227661227661}, {"text": "Question 9 continues on page 11", "x0": 0.3637362637362637, "y0": 0.8197358197358198, "x1": 0.6373626373626373, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}, {"text": "-10-", "x0": 0.48021978021978023, "y0": 0.9456099456099456, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.9549339549339549}], [{"text": "Question 9 (continued)", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.08935508935508936, "x1": 0.3076923076923077, "y1": 0.10256410256410256}, {"text": "The prescribed texts for Section III are:", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.12198912198912198, "x1": 0.43846153846153846, "y1": 0.1351981351981352}, {"text": "+ Prose Fiction \u2014 Kate Chopin, The Awakening", "x0": 0.13186813186813187, "y0": 0.1554001554001554, "x1": 0.5659340659340659, "y1": 0.1686091686091686}, {"text": "\u2014 Elizabeth Harrower, The Fun of the Fair", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.18026418026418026, "x1": 0.656043956043956, "y1": 0.19347319347319347}, {"text": "\u2014 Franz Kafka, Metamorphosis", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.20590520590520592, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.2191142191142191}, {"text": "\u2014 Nam Le, Love and Honour and Pity and Pride and Compassion", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.23076923076923078, "x1": 0.8417582417582418, "y1": 0.24397824397824397}, {"text": "and Sacrifice", "x0": 0.32857142857142857, "y0": 0.24864024864024864, "x1": 0.4340659340659341, "y1": 0.2618492618492618}, {"text": "\u2014 Colum McCann, Thirteen Ways of Looking", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.2742812742812743, "x1": 0.6758241758241759, "y1": 0.2874902874902875}, {"text": "\u2014 Colum McCann, What Time Is It Now, Where Are You?", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.29914529914529914, "x1": 0.7769230769230769, "y1": 0.31157731157731156}, {"text": "\u2014 Rohinton Mistry, The Ghost of Firozsha Baag", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.32400932400932403, "x1": 0.7, "y1": 0.3372183372183372}, {"text": "+ Nonfiction | \u2014 Helen Garner, How to Marry Your Daughters", "x0": 0.13186813186813187, "y0": 0.36752136752136755, "x1": 0.6967032967032967, "y1": 0.39083139083139085}, {"text": "Siri Hustvedt, Eight Days in a Corset", "x0": 0.32967032967032966, "y0": 0.39937839937839936, "x1": 0.6296703296703297, "y1": 0.4125874125874126}, {"text": "\u2014 George Orwell, Politics and the English Language", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.425019425019425, "x1": 0.7362637362637363, "y1": 0.4382284382284382}, {"text": "\u2014 Zadie Smith, That Crafty Feeling", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.44988344988344986, "x1": 0.5978021978021978, "y1": 0.4630924630924631}, {"text": "+ Speeches \u2014 Margaret Atwood, Spotty-Handed Villainesses